4,The Manganiyar Classroom: Indian children bring endangered music to Australia | Womadelaide | The Guardian,https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2017/mar/10/the-manganiyar-classroom-indian-children-bring-endangered-music-to-australia,"March 9, 2021 - The intensity of this experience led Abel to arrange funding to create a theatre show with Manganiyar music at its core. This project became the highly acclaimed Manganiyar Seduction, which wowed Australian audiences when it toured in 2012.",Mangarrayi,Australian
5,"Full article: Warrma Mangarrayi: Co-Designing an App for Learning Mangarrayi, an Indigenous Language of Northern Australia",https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/10447318.2024.2381924?af=R,"To keep data storage requirements at a reasonable level for the average mobile phone, mp3 files were used for audio with a limit of 100 KB. A Kriol mp3 audio translation recorded by JL and WaG was provided in addition to the Mangarrayi recording as for many Jilkminggan community members a variety of northern Australian Kriol rather than English is their first language (Section 2.2).",Mangarrayi,Australian
